---
description: Prepare one reviewCoherence evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: BrandAsset[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Compare the asset collection for conceptual, terminological, and factual coherence. Separate hard defects from subjective creative preference, obtain client review of meaningful alternatives, and version the system and dependent assets together. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
